EAST BAY FOUNDERS - EVENT REMINDER

Hi all, quick reminder that Demo Night is tomorrow, Thursday March 5, at 6:00pm at the Jack London Square space (second floor, the door next to the coffee roaster; ring the bell if it is locked).

The lineup is set: six member companies presenting, five minutes each, including a plant-floor robotics team, a climate fintech, a consumer app that we are told involves houseplants, and three others we will let surprise you. Q&A is two questions per presenter, moderated with a bell.

Doors at 5:45pm. Presentations start at 6:15pm sharp. Tacos and drinks after, until about 8:30pm. The space holds about 80 and we have 74 RSVPs, so if you are bringing a guest, please add them in the portal today so we can count for food.

Parking: the garage on Embarcadero validates for two hours. BART to 12th Street is a fifteen-minute walk. The ferry from SF lands two blocks away and the 5:30pm boat gets you there in time.

If you RSVP'd and can no longer make it, please cancel in the portal so someone on the waitlist can come.

See you tomorrow.

